 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "How it is formed",
     "texto": [
      "**avessi / fossi** (imperfect subjunctive of «avere» or «essere») + past participle: **avessi detto** (you had said), **fossi stato** (you had been).",
      "With **pensavo che** (I thought that): **Pensavo che avessi finito** (I thought you had finished)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "When it is used",
     "texto": [
      "After a verb in the past (**pensavo che, credevo che, mi aveva detto che**): **Pensavo che fossi venuto** (I thought you had come).",
      "It also appears in the past unreal condition, which is studied in chapter 35."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
